{"code":"054180","name":"메디콕스","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"조선","sector_desc":"선박 건조. 수주 잔고와 선가, 강재 가격이 수년에 걸쳐 실적에 반영되는 긴 사이클 업종입니다.","desc":"동사는 1998년 소프트웨어 개발 및 전자기술 용역을 영위할 목적으로 설립되어 1999년 법인 전환, 2001년 코스닥시장에 상장되었으며, 연결대상 종속회사 3개사를 보유하고 있음. 동사는 조선기자재부문과 전동기 및 발전기부문으로 사업을 구성하고 있음. 조선기자재부문에서는 선박의 특수제작 블록을, 전동기 및 발전기부문에서는 효성중공업 등에 OEM 생산하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-23","n_days":300,"close":2295.0,"open":2295.0,"high":2295.0,"low":2295.0,"volume":0,"amount":0.0,"ret_1d":0.0,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":0.0,"ret_5":0.0,"ret_20":0.0,"ret_60":0.0,"ret_120":0.0,"ret_250":0.0,"ma20":2295.0,"ma60":2295.0,"ma120":2295.0,"ma200":2295.0,"close_vs_ma200":0.0,"close_vs_ma60":0.0,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":0.0,"r2_60":0.0,"slope_120":0.0,"r2_120":0.0,"slope_250":0.0,"r2_250":0.0,"high52":2295.0,"low52":0.0,"pos_52w":100.0,"dd_52w":0.0,"mdd_1y":0.0,"atr14_pct":57.1429,"vol_ann_60":0.0,"vol_avg20":0.0,"vol_ratio20":null,"vr5":null,"vr20":null,"amount_avg5":0.0,"amount_avg20":0.0,"amount_avg60":0.0,"obv_chg20":null,"turnover_20":0.0,"pv_eff_20":null,"rsi14":null,"frgn_net_5":0.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_20":0.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_60":0.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_120":0.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.0,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":0.0,"foreign_ratio":0.0,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.0,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":-11.0,"op_margin_q":-17.1875,"op_qoq":-10.0,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":26.6667,"rev_yoy":-16.8831,"op_trend_4q":-2.7907,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-16.38,"debt_ratio":54.46,"per":null,"pbr":0.28,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":0.0,"target_price":null,"recomm":null,"nxt_close":null,"nxt_change_pct":null,"cns_per":null,"code":"054180","name":"메디콕스","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_code":"291","sector_name":"조선","marcap":126867163